  "View and edit network interface configuration.\n\n  • Enable/disable DHCP and IPv6 auto-configuration\n  • Add or remove static IP aliases\n  • Set MTU, VLAN tag, bridge members, LAG ports, and more\n  • Apply changes (with automatic rollback safety)\n  • Persist changes once the network is confirmed working\n\nPress Enter to select an interface to edit.\nPress [n] to create a new interface, [d] to delete.\nAfter editing, use [a] to Apply and [p] to Persist.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Besjoch en bewurkje netwurkynterfacekonfiguraasje.\n\n  • Ynskeakelje / útskeakelje DHCP en IPv6 auto-konfiguraasje\n  • Foegje of fuortsmite statyske IP-aliassen\n  • Set MTU, VLAN tag, brêge leden, LAG havens, en mear\n  • Feroarings tapasse (mei automatyske weromrolfeiligens)\n  • Persist feroarings ienris it netwurk wurdt befêstige wurkjen\n\nDruk op Enter om in ynterface te selektearjen om te bewurkjen.\nDruk op [n] om in nije ynterface te meitsjen, [d] om te wiskjen.\nBrûk nei it bewurkjen [a] om oan te passen en [p] om te bliuwen."
  },
  "View your account information and manage credentials.\n\n  • View username, UID, roles, and 2FA status\n  • Change your password\n  • Generate a one-time password for single-use login\n  • Set up or renew two-factor authentication\n\nPassword changes take effect immediately.\nOne-time passwords expire after a single login.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Besjoch jo akkountynformaasje en beheare bewiisbrieven.\n\n  • Besjoch brûkersnamme, UID, rollen en 2FA-status\n  • Feroarje jo wachtwurd\n  • Generearje in ienmalige wachtwurd foar ien-gebrûk login\n  • Ynstelle of fernije twa-faktor autentikaasje\n\nWachtwurdwizigingen nimme daliks effekt.\nIenmalige wachtwurden ferrinne nei ien inkelde oanmelding."
